# Everything in this folder is ignored by default. This folder mixes a
# few real, committed static files with content regenerated at build or
# preview time (dist/, library/, search-index.json, and whatever gets
# added later by a future build step). Flipping the default to "ignored"
# means a new generated folder is safe by default — nothing needs to be
# added here to keep it out of git. A genuinely new static asset that
# SHOULD be committed needs one explicit "!" line below.
*
!.gitignore
!llms.txt
